                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Brick Breaker Ultimate is another 100% Asset Flip by the fake developer, RewindApp. As a matter of fact, all of their games just take complete project templates from the Unity store and do little customization themselves and thus profit off of someone else’s work.\nUnity asset used: https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/templates/packs/ballx-infinite-brick-breaker-complete-game-template-87125\n\nAdditionally, this game has a design flaw where it starts out hard and becomes too easy rather quickly.  At first the player needs to make some skill shots to strategically take out the bricks before they fall to the bottom.  However, extra balls are quickly gathered.  Once a handful of balls are obtained all the player needs to do is shoot them horizontally and the game plays itself.  It attempts to become more difficult with increasing number of hits per block, but all this does is make each level play for a longer period of time.  I was only able to make it to about level 100 before at least one of the balls leapt out of the play area and caused an infinite loop.",
